@ref Employment Insurance Regulations Schedule II.7 (src:2034-2078)
GIVEN hours IS A NUMBER
      band IS A `Rate band`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `Regs Sch II.7 the weeks of benefits for the hours and the rate band` IS
    CONSIDER `Regs Sch II.7 the row of the table for the hours of insurable employment in the qualifying period` hours
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST row THEN JUST (`er6 the weeks in the column for the band` row band)

